:''For the stronger variant introduced later in [[The Aku Realms]], see [[High Priest Mamon]].''
'''Dark Priest Mamon''' (神官マモーン ''Shinkan Mamōn'', "'''Priest Mamon'''") is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemy introduced in stage 30 of [[The Aku Realms]], [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)|Mount Aku/Mount Fuji]]. He was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Dark Priest Mamon
|image = E 570.png
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
|appearance = '''The Aku Realms:''' [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)|Mount Aku/Mount Fuji]]
}}

==Enemy==
Dark Priest Mamon is a powerful enemy, with basically no shortcomings. High offensive and defensive capabilities, good range with added [[Hitbox#Subdivisions|piercing range]] and [[Area Attack]]. He's purely an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemy, not [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]], and his long attack animation is his only weakness to exploit.

His stats may not seem threatening, but keep in mind that an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]] will be more than enough to fix this issue when he is first encountered.

==Strategy==
Dark Priest Mamon isn't too hard to stall, so units who can outrange him and take out his support, if paired with fast meatshields, can overcome the challenges he poses.

