|A [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy found at the end of the [[Underground Labyrinth]]. Very similar to High Priest Mamon, but with even higher health and attack power, no Shield or Toxic ability and a 20% chance to slow units for 4 seconds.
