|Grand Emperor Warumongar
|A supersized variant of Emperor Warumongar, with superior health/damage and an Omni Strike that pierces up to 570 range in exchange for a much slower attack rate and no Shield.
|Enchanting Mage Vibon
|An [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijin]] variant of Grand Mage Mimon that exchanges her Slow and Omni Strike for Long Distance, a 100% chance to Weaken, and a Level 3 [[Surge Attack]]. She  also has lower attack, but slightly higher health.
}}

